  "prefLabel": "Pes 101.06 Commercial applicator not for hire",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pes 101.06 \"Commercial applicator not for hire\" means those commercial applicators who apply pesticides to their own premises, that of their immediate employers or when performing duties required of\n\nthem by a governmental subdivision, and any other commercial applicator other than a \"commercial applicator for hire\", including but not limited to golf course personnel, state, federal and municipal employees.\n\nSource. #1058.1, eff 11-22-77; ss by #2209, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2781, eff 7-26-84; ss by #4867, eff 7-19-90; ss and moved by #6239, eff 5-2-96 (from Pes 101.05)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/pes100.html"
